 "400.47.0": {
  "tag": "cli%400.47.0",
  "date": "2026-10-05T13:38:37Z",
  "text": "New Features \u2728 Cli Add replay download command by @gggritso in #1392 Add dsn list command by @betegon in #1365 Add feedback spam command by @betegon in #1372 Add feedback unresolve command by @betegon in #1369 Add feedback resolve command by @betegon in #1366 Other (search) Split search_events into dataset-specific tools by @sentry-junior in #1374 Bug Fixes \ud83d\udc1b Cli Validate repository list responses by @betegon in #1364 Preserve a 401 on the final request attempt by @betegon in #1370 Other (api) Accept null legacy event context by @betegon in #1353 (cloudflare) Upload built Worker and SPA assets by @BYK in #1400 Internal Changes \ud83d\udd27 Update SDK to v11.1.0 and migrate tags to attributes by @JPeer264 in #1347 Other Install CLI nightlies from Toolkit GHCR by @BYK in #1403 Test the exact production Worker version before promotion by @BYK in #1399 Move Cloudflare token to protected production environment by @BYK in #1394 Publish Toolkit CLI nightlies to GHCR by @BYK in #1393 Restore CLI changelog with automatic workspace notes by @BYK in #1362 Restore guarded MCP production deployment by @BYK in #1359 Regenerate CLI skill files for 0.47.0 by @BYK in #1360",
  "url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-mcp/releases/tag/cli%400.47.0"
 },
 "400.46.0": {
  "tag": "cli%400.46.0",
  "date": "2026-10-01T17:20:54Z",
  "text": "0.46.0 New Features \u2728 Move the CLI and its documentation to getsentry/toolkit , preserving their Git history. Stable installers now fetch exact cli@ releases from Toolkit, with a legacy fallback only when Toolkit returns 404, in #1354 . Configure Toolkit to publish the CLI binaries, npm package, Homebrew formula, and website in #1354 . Bug Fixes \ud83d\udc1b Keep CLI typechecking offline and support the ignored API schema in fresh checkouts in #1320 . Parse compact GitHub release responses, skip prerelease tags for stable installations, and preserve setup and upgrade compatibility in #1320 . Silence Seer errors on self-hosted instances without suppressing SaaS telemetry in getsentry/cli#1651 . Keep the v3 migration shim working for a release named new in #1320 . Documentation \ud83d\udcda Point the CLI website's GitHub link to Toolkit in #1358 .",
  "url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-mcp/releases/tag/cli%400.46.0"
 },
